 Assume for the sake of contradiction that for all $s\in S$ it holds that $\bb{E}[R\medspace | \medspace S=s]<\bb{E}[R]$. Define the random variable $Y=\bb{E}[R]-R$, and observe that due to  our assumption,
 \begin{align}
